    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald welcomes you to 23 Dooneen Road, an incredibly spacious home which has been extended to provide unrivalled accommodation, which offers versatility and fantastic potential as a large family home, or astute investment property. Presented beautifully throughout, the property is in walk in condition and is offered with no onward chain, with fantastic potential to command a generous rental income. This is a unique opportunity which should be viewed to fully appreciate.\n\nAt the front of the home there is a lawned garden with walls and fencing to the front and side, with ample off street parking on a tarmac driveway. There is a storm porch entrance welcoming you to the house and into the bright, wide entrance hall with stairs to the first floor, with a small storage area underneath. To the immediate right is a living room with carpet floor and a feature gas fireplace. The accommodation then opens into a large kitchen area, which also functions as a generous living space with room for seating and dining and French doors to the rear garden. The modern kitchen units center around am island unit, ideal for food preparation and entertaining. There is a hallway off the kitchen which leads to the ground floor bedrooms and a small utility room. There are three double bedrooms on this level, as well as a modern shower room with fully tiled walls and floor and white suite sanitary ware. Upstairs there are three further bedrooms (two doubles and a single) and a further modern shower room with contemporary fittings and tiled walls and flooring. \n\nOutside, there is an enclosed rear garden with lawn, patio and flower beds and borders, with an ornamental fishpond and crazy paving finishing this appealing outdoor space. \n\nThe location is excellent, with a host of amenities on the doorstep, Woodview Shopping Centre is just minutes away, along with Thomond Community College and TUS Moylish Campus also just a short walk from the house. There are numerous sporting facilities in the area with Thomond Rugby Club, Thomond Park and Limerick Gaelic Grounds, all within walking distance. The city centre is just a short distance from the property, as is the N18 to Shannon Airport and Limerick Southern ring road for commuters. Jetland Shopping Centre is a short drive away and offers a multitude of shops, grocery stores and eateries. \n\nAccommodation: \nPorch, entrance hall, living room, kitchen/living room, utility, three ground floor bedrooms and ground floor shower room, three upstairs bedrooms and shower room. Gas fired central heating. \n\nViewing by appointment."
      },
